srem5: x % 5, for x from -999 to 999, with the sign of x. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-18, with x in cell 90 and a scratch cell t0 in cell 91.
Copy cells 10-18 to where the program needs x % 5, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x and each 91 to a free cell; the program goes on with x % 5 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator and t0; x is kept.
Size 10 cells (9 instructions and t0). It runs 9 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-13: 2x; its last digit (twice the remainder) kept, times 100, by SFT 31
 11     290      ADD 90
 12     431      SFT 31
 13     691      STO 91
 14     291      ADD 91   cells 14-18: times 5, divided by 1000
 15     291      ADD 91
 16     291      ADD 91
 17     291      ADD 91
 18     403      SFT 03
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
 91     000      data: t0, scratch
